    "detailed_description": "AERO BATTLE ROYALE is the indie air racing game that throws you into the heart of exhilarating skies. Master the art of piloting high-performance aircraft in a stunning environment filled with breathtaking visuals and pulse-pounding races.<br><br>But this is no ordinary race. AERO BATTLE ROYALE throws a wrench or should we say, a missile into the mix by letting you unleash an arsenal of weapons on your opponents! Turn the skies into a battleground for ultimate air supremacy and be the last pilot standing.<br><br>Soar Solo or Squad Up: Take to the skies solo or team up with friends and family for epic online battles. AERO BATTLE ROYALE offers exciting gameplay for everyone, making it the perfect choice for a thrilling game night. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118620/extras/07a68dafd002c08e995e564d30a7d91a.poster.avif?t=1723673716\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118620/extras/07a68dafd002c08e995e564d30a7d91a.webm?t=1723673716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118620/extras/07a68dafd002c08e995e564d30a7d91a.mp4?t=1723673716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Clearer Headline: Captures the essence of the game (air racing + battle royale)<br>Stronger Introduction: Focuses on action and excitement.<br>Explains Weaponry: Highlights the unique &quot;dogfight&quot; aspect.<br>Family-Friendly Appeal: Mentions co-op play without sounding forced.<br>Call to Action: Encourages fans to follow for updates.",
